# Data and Code Availability

The Python source code required to reproduce the reported experiments and
analyses, together with detailed dataset metadata, file-naming definitions,
object-configuration-based LOSO information, representative anonymized
multichannel acoustic recordings, and reproducibility documentation, is
publicly available in the GitHub repository:

https://github.com/nevzatolgun/NLOS_acoustic_identity_recognition

The associated Zenodo record is available at:

https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21802627

